> > kernel + xenomai (and some kernel hacking option).
> > 
> > 
> Could you try to turn off CONFIG_NO_HZ ?

Without CONFIG_NO_HZ, it hangs repeatably during the boot (in the same
place than with CONFIG_NO_HZ without CONFIG_DEBUG_LOCK_ALLOC, so this
last option is more a timing workaround than a "real fix"). See the
attached defconfig and boot log.

Best regards,
